    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49081" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Trĭfŏlīnus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to
